You have both sentiments yet to experience.

57
00:04:45,419 --> 00:04:46,419
Your soul sleeps.

58
00:04:46,979 --> 00:04:49,139
The shock is yet to be given, which shall wake in it.

59
00:04:49,860 --> 00:04:55,279
You think all existence lapses in as choir to flow, as that in which your youth has

60
00:04:55,280 --> 00:05:01,439
hitherto slid away, floating on with closed eyes and muffled ears.

61
